d":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 9 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Gameplan live for Alex Nicola","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Alex)","d":"Shoot is Sat Nov 21, 2026, 9:00 AM ET at Atlanta studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Alex and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-12T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 12, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Alex Nicola)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Sat Nov 21, 2026.","u":"2026-11-13T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 13, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:G1","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14).","u":"2026-11-13T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SK1","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Alex Nicola)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Alex)","d":"Call sheet to Alex and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM ET, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Sat Nov 21, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-19T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 19, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:H1","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Test shoot 1: Alex","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Atlanta studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-11-21T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Nov 21, 9:00 AM ET","en":"2026-11-21T22:00:00Z","loc":"Atlanta studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SKP","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Guardian-led plan. Keep it to a gentle cleanser, moisturizer and SPF 30+. No acids, retinoids, peels or treatments unless a pediatrician or dermatologist and your guardian both approve. Climate: warm and humid. A light lotion moisturizer and SPF daily. Rinse after workouts. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:WK1","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Alex)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-11-24T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 24, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Alex Nicola)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"Guardian-led plan. Regular family meals and snacks with protein, fruit and vegetables, enough food to grow and train, 8 to 10 hours of sleep and plenty of water. No calorie limits, no weight or measurement targets, and no supplements without a pediatrician. Easy picks: bowls with a grilled protein, a whole grain and vegetables; eggs, Greek yogurt, oats, fruit and nuts. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Alex Nicola)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-11-27T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Alex)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-02T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 2, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Alex)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-04T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 4, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Alex Nicola and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: New York Mon Feb 8 to Sun Feb 14 (NYFW castings with guardian). Estimated total $2,541 (flights $600, housing $840, meals and transport $630, transfers $240, visa and insurance $0, 10% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advance and recoup terms (Alex Nicola)","d":"Estimated travel and stay about $2,541. Please confirm you accept the advance and how it is recouped.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $2,541","d":"Your season itinerary: New York Mon Feb 8 to Sun Feb 14 (NYFW castings with guardian). Estimated total $2,541: flights $600, housing $840, meals and local transport $630, airport transfers $240, visa and insurance $0, contingency $231. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET","amt":2541},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $2,541).","u":"2026-12-11T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Alex Nicola)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $2,541.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"