lex Nicola","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:H2","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Pediatrician check-up, dental cleaning and vision check by the dates in your gameplan, with your guardian. You share only 'cleared' or 'not cleared' with MDV. School hours and sleep come first. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:H2e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:H3","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Alex)","d":"Shoot is Sat Jan 9, 2027, 9:00 AM ET at Atlanta studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Alex and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-26T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Dec 26, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (Alex Nicola)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Sat Jan 9, 2027.","u":"2026-12-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (Alex)","d":"Call sheet to Alex and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM ET, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2027-01-06T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 6, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:CK1","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Mid-season check-in call with your agent","d":"30 minutes: how you feel, sleep, food, skin, walk and travel. Bring questions.","u":"2027-01-06T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"meeting","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 6, 5:00 PM ET","en":"2027-01-06T22:30:00Z","loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-confirm","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Confirm your test shoot 2 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Sat Jan 9, 2027. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2027-01-07T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 7, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Test shoot 2: Alex","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Atlanta studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2027-01-09T14:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Jan 9, 9:00 AM ET","en":"2027-01-09T22:00:00Z","loc":"Atlanta studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-selects","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: send selects (Alex)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2027-01-12T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Jan 12, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 selects (Alex Nicola)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2027-01-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-approve","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Approve your test shoot 2 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2027-01-14T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 14, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Alex)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2027-01-19T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Jan 19, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Alex)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2027-01-21T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 21, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SK3","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:WK3","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:WK3e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Walk practice video #3 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-25T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 25, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:DG","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Digitals session (Alex)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-30T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Sat Jan 30, 11:00 AM ET","en":"2027-01-30T18:00:00Z","loc":"Atlanta","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SK4","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM ET.","u":"2027-02-01T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T22:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:PA6","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm arrival date and emergency contact (Alex Nicola)","d":"Arrival Mon Feb 8, 2027. Confirm the contact and, for anyone under 18, the guardian.","u":"2027-02-02T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Feb 2, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-house","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Housing confirmed and address sent (Alex Nicola)","d":"Confirm the bed, key pickup and house rules and send them to the model and mother agency.","u":"2027-02-02T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Feb 2, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Alex Nicola)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-02-02T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Feb 2, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Alex Nicola)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-02-03T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Feb 3, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-ready","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Pre-flight check: documents, health and packing","d":"Passport, visa, tickets, insurance card, prescriptions, charger, walking shoes and your skin kit. Confirm you are ready.","u":"2027-02-05T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Feb 5, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:TR-arr","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Arrival: Alex lands","d":"Landing in New York. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-02-08T17:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Feb 8, 12:00 PM ET","en":null,"loc":"New York","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:alex-nicola:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Alex Nicola","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Alex)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-02-09T15:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Feb 9, 10:00 AM ET","en":"2027-02-09T15:45:00Z","loc":"New York","ek":"walk practice"}]},{"name":"David Aluko","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-19","key_label":"Paris Men's FW27-28","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, David. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Men's FW27-28 (Tue Jan 19 to Sun Jan 24).","market":"Base: Lagos. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Schengen visa must be filed by Nov 13 and decided by Dec 21. No decision means a same-day fallback plan. May sign in Milan. Decision Dec 4 changes the visa country and adds a Milan leg (Jan 15 to 19).","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:david-aluko:V1","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Passport check and scans","d":"Passport valid at least 6 months after your return with 2 blank pages. Upload a clear scan today.","u":"2026-11-10T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Tue Nov 10, 5:00 PM Lagos (Tue Nov 10 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Gameplan live for David Aluko","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:PA2","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Send visa support documents (David Aluko)","d":"Invitation or agency letter and any contract pages needed for the Schengen application.","u":"2026-11-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:V2","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Visa pack complete for David Aluko","d":"Support letter, accommodation proof, travel insurance, finances, flight reservation, photos.","u":"2026-11-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:V3e","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Visa filing day","d":"Visa application and biometrics.","u":"2026-11-13T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"visa","h":false,"ar":"Visa","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 13, 10:00 AM Lagos (Fri Nov 13 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-11-13T11:00:00Z","loc":null,"ek":"visa appointment"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:G1","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28.","u":"2026-11-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Nov 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:V3","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Visa application filed and biometrics done","d":"Attend your visa centre appointment with every document. Tell your agent the moment it is done.","u":"2026-11-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Visa","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Nov 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:SK1","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:SK1e","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (David)","d":"Shoot is Mon Nov 30, 2026, 9:00 AM Lagos at Lagos studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to David and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-16T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (David Aluko)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved. If the model is signing in Milan, tell us by Dec 4.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:H1","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Nov 20 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:SKP","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: heat and humidity. Use a gel or light lotion moisturizer. For breakouts or dark marks after breakouts, ask the reviewer about niacinamide in the morning and azelaic acid at night. Reapply SPF every 2 to 3 hours outdoors and rinse sweat off before it dries. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:WK1","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:WK1e","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (David Aluko)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Mon Nov 30, 2026.","u":"2026-11-23T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:FUEL","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy local picks: grilled or steamed fish or chicken, beans or moi moi, efo riro or ugu with less oil, boiled or grilled plantain, ofada or brown rice, and fruit like pawpaw, oranges and watermelon. Jollof and fried snacks are fine in smaller portions with a protein beside them. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Lagos (Wed Nov 25 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (David Aluko)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Mon Nov 30, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-27T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 27, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Nov 27 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (David)","d":"Call sheet to David and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lagos, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS1","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Test shoot 1: David","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lagos studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-11-30T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 30, 9:00 AM Lagos (Mon Nov 30 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-11-30T16:00:00Z","loc":"Lagos studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:V4","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Visa statu