% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (David)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-09T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 9, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (David Aluko)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Thu Dec 17, 2026.","u":"2026-12-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $3,168","d":"Your season itinerary: Paris Sun Jan 10 to Mon Jan 25 (Paris Men's). Estimated total $3,168: flights $1,150, housing $825, meals and local transport $560, airport transfers $120, visa and insurance $225, contingency $288. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 11 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-11T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 11 11:00 AM ET)","amt":3168},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $3,168).","u":"2026-12-11T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 11 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advanc