he front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:WK2e","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (David Aluko)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $3,168.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (David)","d":"Call sheet to David and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lagos, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS2-confirm","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Confirm your test shoot 2 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Thu Dec 17, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-15T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Tue Dec 15, 5:00 PM Lagos (Tue Dec 15 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:TS2","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Test shoot 2: David","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lagos studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"202