","d":"Landing in Paris. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-01-10T11:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Sun Jan 10, 12:00 PM Paris (Sun Jan 10 6:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":"Paris","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Walk-off with your agent (David)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-01-11T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 10:00 AM Paris (Mon Jan 11 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-11T09:45:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:DG","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Digitals session (David)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-13T10:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 13, 11:00 AM Paris (Wed Jan 13 5:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-13T12:00:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (David Aluko)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-01-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (David Aluko)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:SK4","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:david-aluko:SK4e","a":"model","o":"David Aluko","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Fernanda Vega","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-25","key_label":"Paris Haute Couture SS27","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Fernanda. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Haute Couture SS27 (Mon Jan 25 to Thu Jan 28); Paris Women's FW27-28 (Mon Mar 1 to Tue Mar 9).","market":"Base: Mexico City. Shows: Paris Haute Couture SS27, Paris Women's FW27-28.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Earlier DaySilk note says she may be released because of age; this plan follows your Nov 8 list (Couture + Women's).","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Gameplan live for Fernanda Vega","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:G1","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: Paris Haute Couture SS27, Paris Women's FW27-28.","u":"2026-11-13T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Nov 13 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK1","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 16 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 16 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 16 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:H1","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Nov 20 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Fernanda)","d":"Shoot is Mon Dec 7, 2026, 9:00 AM Mexico City at Mexico City studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Fernanda and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-23T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 23, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SKP","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: altitude and strong UV. Use SPF 50, a hat in the sun, a hyaluronic serum under moisturizer, and drink extra water. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 23 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WK1","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 23 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 23 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Nov 23 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: black beans, grilled chicken or fish, corn tortillas, avocado, nopales, lean pozole and fruit. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Wed Nov 25 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Mon Dec 7, 2026.","u":"2026-11-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Fernanda)","d":"Call sheet to Fernanda and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Mexico City, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-04T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 4, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Mon Dec 7, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-04T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 4, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 4 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Test shoot 1: Fernanda","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Mexico City studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-07T15:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Dec 7, 9:00 AM Mexico City (Mon Dec 7 10:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-07T23:00:00Z","loc":"Mexico City studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Fernanda Vega and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: Paris Wed Jan 20 to Fri Jan 29 (Couture); Paris Fri Feb 26 to Wed Mar 10 (Women's). Estimated total $5,060 (flights $2,400, housing $1,155, meals and transport $805, transfers $240, visa and insurance $0, 10% contingency). Replace the estimate with real quotes first.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Fernanda)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-09T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 9, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:PA4","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Co-sign travel advance and recoup terms (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Estimated travel and stay about $5,060. Please confirm you accept the advance and how it is recouped.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-approve","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Approve your travel and stay plan: about $5,060","d":"Your season itinerary: Paris Wed Jan 20 to Fri Jan 29 (Couture); Paris Fri Feb 26 to Wed Mar 10 (Women's). Estimated total $5,060: flights $2,400, housing $1,155, meals and local transport $805, airport transfers $240, visa and insurance $0, contingency $460. This is an estimate until tickets are booked; final numbers are shown before anything is charged. Tap Complete to approve, or request a change with a note. Due Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 11 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-11T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 11 6:00 PM ET)","amt":5060},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-approve-e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Travel plan approval due","d":"Approve the travel and stay estimate (about $5,060).","u":"2026-12-11T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 11 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"travel"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-11T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 11 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-fund","a":"staff","o":"Sophia","t":"Release travel advance after approvals (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Only after the model and mother agency approve. Estimated $5,060.","u":"2026-12-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK2","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Dec 14 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Dec 14 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Dec 14 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WK2","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk video #2: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Dec 14 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Dec 14 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WK2e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk practice video #2 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Dec 14 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Fernanda)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-tix","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Tickets issued for Fernanda Vega","d":"Book flights only when the visa (if needed) is in the passport and the travel plan is approved. Send e-tickets to the model and mother agency.","u":"2026-12-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":true,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Fernanda)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:H2","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your clinician advises (iron, vitamin D, B12 and thyroid are common for travel season), a dental cleaning and a vision check, all by the dates in your gameplan. You choose what to share: MDV only needs 'cleared' or 'not cleared', never your results. Travel health: ask your clinician about vaccines or medicines for your route, carry a copy of prescriptions, and bring your insurance card. Due Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 18 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2026-12-18T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 18 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:H2e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Health layout due: physical, dental, vision","d":"Tell your agent you are cleared.","u":"2026-12-18T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 18 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:H3","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Dental cleaning and vision check: done","d":"Book both and tell your agent 'done'. Bring glasses or contact prescriptions if you use them.","u":"2026-12-18T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Dec 18, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Dec 18 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Fernanda)","d":"Shoot is Mon Jan 11, 2027, 9:00 AM Mexico City at Mexico City studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Fernanda and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-28T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 28, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Mon Jan 11, 2027.","u":"2027-01-04T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 4, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:CK1","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Mid-season check-in call with your agent","d":"30 minutes: how you feel, sleep, food, skin, walk and travel. Bring questions.","u":"2027-01-06T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"meeting","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Wed Jan 6, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Wed Jan 6 6:00 PM ET)","en":"2027-01-06T23:30:00Z","loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (Fernanda)","d":"Call sheet to Fernanda and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Mexico City, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2027-01-08T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 8, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-confirm","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Confirm your test shoot 2 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Mon Jan 11, 2027. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2027-01-08T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Jan 8, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Jan 8 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Test shoot 2: Fernanda","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Mexico City studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2027-01-11T15:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Jan 11, 9:00 AM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 10:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-11T23:00:00Z","loc":"Mexico City studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK3","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2027-01-11T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-11T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WK3","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2027-01-11T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WK3e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk practice video #3 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-11T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Jan 11, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Jan 11 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send selects (Fernanda)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2027-01-13T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 13, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:PA6","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm arrival date and emergency contact (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Arrival Wed Jan 20, 2027. Confirm the contact and, for anyone under 18, the guardian.","u":"2027-01-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-house","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Housing confirmed and address sent (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Confirm the bed, key pickup and house rules and send them to the model and mother agency.","u":"2027-01-14T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Jan 14, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 selects (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2027-01-15T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 15, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-ready","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Pre-flight check: documents, health and packing","d":"Passport, visa, tickets, insurance card, prescriptions, charger, walking shoes and your skin kit. Confirm you are ready.","u":"2027-01-15T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Jan 15, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Jan 15 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-approve","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Approve your test shoot 2 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2027-01-15T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Fri Jan 15, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Fri Jan 15 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TR-arr","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Arrival: Fernanda lands","d":"Landing in Paris. Airport pickup and address are in your gameplan.","u":"2027-01-20T11:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"travel","h":false,"ar":"Travel","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 20, 12:00 PM Paris (Wed Jan 20 6:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":"Paris","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: retouched finals delivered (Fernanda)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2027-01-20T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 20, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Fernanda)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-01-21T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Thu Jan 21, 10:00 AM Paris (Thu Jan 21 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-21T09:45:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:DG","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Digitals session (Fernanda)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-22T10:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Jan 22, 11:00 AM Paris (Fri Jan 22 5:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-22T12:00:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:TS2-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: add to book and push the package (Fernanda)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2027-01-22T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 22, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-01-26T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Jan 26, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Fernanda Vega)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-01-27T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Jan 27, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK4","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Feb 1 6:00 PM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T23:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Feb 1 6:00 PM ET)"},{"i":"g90:fernanda-vega:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Fernanda Vega","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T23:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"America/Mexico_City","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Mexico City (Mon Feb 1 6:00 PM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Krishita Shetty","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-03-15","key_label":"Spring editorial window opens","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Krishita. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Emma.","positioning":"Editorial and print focus this season. No runway push.","market":"Base: Mumbai. Editorial and campaign bookings; spring window opens Mar 15.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Pose practice, two check dates","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Pose practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Pose practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Gameplan live for Krishita Shetty","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:G1","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: editorial and print focus.","u":"2026-11-13T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Fri Nov 13 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:SK1","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Nov 16 6:30 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Nov 16 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T11:30:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Nov 16 6:30 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Krishita Shetty)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:H1","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Fri Nov 20 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:PO1","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Pose sheet #1: send your 10 poses","d":"Editorial practice (no runway push): 10 poses in 3 looks in front of a mirror, plus 5 expressions for close-ups. Send a 10-pose contact sheet each check date. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Nov 23 6:30 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Nov 23 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:SKP","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: heat and humidity. Use a gel or light lotion moisturizer. For breakouts or dark marks after breakouts, ask the reviewer about niacinamide in the morning and azelaic acid at night. Reapply SPF every 2 to 3 hours outdoors and rinse sweat off before it dries. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Nov 23 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: dal, roti or rice in a measured portion, sabzi, eggs, curd, paneer or chicken, and fruit.","u":"2026-11-25T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Wed Nov 25 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Krishita Shetty)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Krishita)","d":"Shoot is Thu Dec 10, 2026, 9:00 AM Mumbai at Mumbai studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Krishita and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-26T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 26, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Krishita Shetty)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Thu Dec 10, 2026.","u":"2026-12-03T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 3, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Emma","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Krishita)","d":"Call sheet to Krishita and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Mumbai, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Thu Dec 10, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-08T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Tue Dec 8, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Tue Dec 8 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:TS1","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Test shoot 1: Krishita","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Mumbai studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-10T03:30:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Thu Dec 10, 9:00 AM Mumbai (Wed Dec 9 10:30 PM ET)","en":"2026-12-10T11:30:00Z","loc":"Mumbai studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:PO