eaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Feb 1 6:30 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T11:30:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Feb 1 6:30 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:krishita-shetty:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Krishita Shetty","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T11:30:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Asia/Kolkata","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Mumbai (Mon Feb 1 6:30 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Mairbek Benoy","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-19","key_label":"Paris Men's FW27-28","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Mairbek. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Men's FW27-28 (Tue Jan 19 to Sun Jan 24); New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14) (Wed Feb 10 to Tue Feb 16).","market":"Base: Paris. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28, New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14).","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Work-permit / entry status is being confirmed by Nov 13.","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Walk practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Walk practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"},{"k":"gp_walkvid","t":"Walk video due dates: Nov 23, Dec 14 and your pre-show date"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Gameplan live for Mairbek Benoy","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Mairbek)","d":"Shoot is Mon Nov 23, 2026, 9:00 AM Paris at Paris studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Mairbek and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-12T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Nov 12, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:G1","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28, New York Fashion Week (CFDA Feb 10-16; Bureau Feb 11-14).","u":"2026-11-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Nov 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:V1","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Tell us your passport and work-permit status","d":"Send your passport photo page and the entry or work permits you already hold.","u":"2026-11-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Visa","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Nov 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:SK1","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Mairbek Benoy)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Mon Nov 23, 2026.","u":"2026-11-16T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 16, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:V2","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Confirm US work authorization (Mairbek Benoy)","d":"If something must be filed, file it by Nov 27 and add the case to the portal. If the model already has it, note the expiry.","u":"2026-11-17T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"visa_travel","h":false,"ar":"Visa","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 17, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Mairbek Benoy)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:H1","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Nov 20 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Mon Nov 23, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-11-20T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Paris (Fri Nov 20 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Mairbek)","d":"Call sheet to Mairbek and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Paris, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-11-20T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 20, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Test shoot 1: Mairbek","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Paris studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-11-23T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 9:00 AM Paris (Mon Nov 23 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","loc":"Paris studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:SKP","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: cool, damp winter and indoor heating. Use a ceramide cream at night, run a humidifier where you sleep, and keep SPF on even when it is cloudy. Pre-show protocol (starts 14 days before your first show): no new active products, no peels, lasers, waxing or fillers in the last 7 days, no sunburn or tanning, sleep 8 hours, and remove all makeup at the end of every day. If anything flares, tell your agent the same day. Travel days: cleanse, put on a thick moisturizer, no new products, drink water through the flight, and use a hydrating mask after landing. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:WK1","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Walk video #1: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulders back, a clean turn at the end, pause, turn back. Practice in the shoe height you expect to wear. Film one 20-second clip from the front and one from the side, phone at hip height, plain background, full body in frame. Your agent gives written feedback and one drill for the next week. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:WK1e","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Walk practice video #1 due","d":"Send your walk video in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy picks: eggs, yogurt or skyr, oats, fish, lentil or bean soups, whole-grain bread, roasted vegetables and fruit. In Paris, bakeries and markets make it simple to pair a protein with a fruit or vegetable. Show weeks: carry snacks (nuts, fruit, a protein bar, a sandwich), eat before every call time, keep water with you, and keep caffeine and alcohol low the night before a casting or show.","u":"2026-11-25T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Paris (Wed Nov 25 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Mairbek Benoy)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Mairbek)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-11-25T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-11-30T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Nov 30, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Nov 30 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Mairbek Benoy)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-11-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Mairbek)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-03T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 3, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TR-offer","a":"staff","o":"Troy","t":"Send travel and stay offer to Mairbek Benoy and mother agency","d":"Itinerary: New York Sat Jan 30 to Wed Feb 17 (NYFW). Estimated total $3,449 (flights $900, housing $1,260, meals and transport $855, t