tylist and studio (Mairbek)","d":"Shoot is Fri Jan 8, 2027, 9:00 AM Paris at Paris studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Mairbek and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-12-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (Mairbek Benoy)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Fri Jan 8, 2027.","u":"2026-12-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:SK3","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Skin submission #3 (pre-show): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-01-04T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:SK3e","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Skin submission #3 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-01-04T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 4, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Jan 4 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:WK3","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Walk video #3: send your 20-second walk","d":"Walk practice, 30 minutes, Tuesday and Thursday. Warm up 5 minutes. Straight-line walk of 10 to 15 steps with level eyes and shoulde