see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:mairbek-benoy:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Mairbek Benoy","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Paris (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Precious Meow","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-01-19","key_label":"Paris Men's FW27-28","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Precious. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Runway: Paris Men's FW27-28 (Tue Jan 19 to Sun Jan 24); Paris Haute Couture SS27 (Mon Jan 25 to Thu Jan 28); Paris Women's FW27-28 (Mon Mar 1 to Tue Mar 9).","market":"Base: Lagos. Shows: Paris Men's FW27-28, Paris Haute Couture SS27, Paris Women's FW27-28.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"Schengen visa must be filed by Nov 13 and decided by Dec 21. No decision means a same-day fallback plan. May sign in Milan. Decision Dec 4 changes the visa country and adds a Milan leg (Jan 15 to 19).","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Tuesday and Thursday 30 minutes","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"202