10 6:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":"Paris","ek":"arrival"},{"i":"g90:samuel-job:WKOFF","a":"model","o":"Samuel Job","t":"Walk-off with your agent (Samuel)","d":"In-person walk check with your agent: straight walk, turns, pace and shoes. About 45 minutes.","u":"2027-01-11T09:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Mon Jan 11, 10:00 AM Paris (Mon Jan 11 4:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-11T09:45:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"walk practice"},{"i":"g90:samuel-job:DG","a":"model","o":"Samuel Job","t":"Digitals session (Samuel)","d":"Fresh digitals for casting: clean face, fitted plain clothes, hair back, no jewelry. Front, profile, back, full length, smile and walk video.","u":"2027-01-13T10:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"Europe/Paris","w":"Wed Jan 13, 11:00 AM Paris (Wed Jan 13 5:00 AM ET)","en":"2027-01-13T12:00:00Z","loc":"Paris","ek":"digitals"},{"i":"g90:samuel-job:DGu","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals up and comp card updated (Samuel Job)","d":"Upload the digitals, update the comp card and measurements, and tell the mother agency.","u":"2027-01-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":true,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Jan 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-job:DGs","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Digitals sent to mother agency and top clients (Samuel Job)","d":"Send the new digitals to the mother agency and the casting directors on this season's list.","u":"2027-01-18T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"casting_show","h":false,"ar":"Digitals","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Jan 18, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:samuel-job:SK4","a":"model","o":"Samuel Job","t":"Skin submission #4 (check): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:samuel-job:SK4e","a":"model","o":"Samuel Job","t":"Skin submission #4 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2027-02-01T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Feb 1, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Feb 1 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"}]},{"name":"Tosin Florence","gp":{"title":"90-Day Gameplan: Nov 8, 2026 to Feb 5, 2027","key_date":"2027-03-15","key_label":"Spring editorial window opens","welcome":"Welcome to your 90-day gameplan, Tosin. Every task has a date and a time in your own time zone. Tap Complete when a task is done, or request a new date with a note. Your agent is Erica.","positioning":"Editorial and print focus this season. No runway push.","market":"Base: Lagos. Editorial and campaign bookings; spring window opens Mar 15.","image_rules":"Test shoots: 2 in this block. Fresh digitals close to your first show. Skin photos four times (Nov 16, Dec 14, pre-show, Feb 1). Nothing is posted or sent without your approval of the selects.","risks":"","cadence":{"daily":"Skin routine morning and night, food and water, sleep 8 hours","walk":"Pose practice, two check dates","weekly":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","deadlines":"All dates and times are in your gameplan tasks"}},"ds":{"built":"2026-11-08","until":"2027-02-05","blocks":[{"id":"gp_snack1","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"10:30","end":"10:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_snack2","days":["0","1","2","3","4","5","6"],"start":"15:30","end":"15:45","title":"Snack + water (fueling plan)","cat":"meal","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_walk","days":["2","4"],"start":"18:00","end":"18:30","title":"Pose practice (gameplan)","cat":"model","until":"2027-02-05"},{"id":"gp_checkin","days":["0"],"start":"17:00","end":"17:20","title":"Sunday wellness check-in with your agent","cat":"routine","until":"2027-02-05"}],"habits":[{"id":"gp_skin","label":"Skin plan from your gameplan: morning and night"},{"id":"gp_fuel","label":"Fueling plan: protein at every meal, two snacks, water"},{"id":"gp_walk","label":"Pose practice Tuesday and Thursday"},{"id":"gp_sleep","label":"Sleep 8 hours"}],"weekly":[{"k":"gp_dates","t":"Open your gameplan: skin photos, walk videos, health checks and test shoots each have a set date and time"}]},"items":[{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:PLAN","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Gameplan live for Tosin Florence","d":"Check that the model sees the gameplan, the mother agency has partner tasks, and the DaySilk events appear.","u":"2026-11-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":true,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Nov 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:G1","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Confirm your gameplan and shows","d":"Open your gameplan, read the dates, and tap Complete to confirm. Shows: editorial and print focus.","u":"2026-11-13T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 13, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Nov 13 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:SK1","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Skin submission #1 (baseline): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:SK1e","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Skin submission #1 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-11-16T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 16, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 16 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:PA1","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Confirm representation and show list (Tosin Florence)","d":"Confirm who represents the model for each market and which shows are approved.","u":"2026-11-18T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 18, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:H1","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Health intake: allergies, food limits, injuries","d":"Fill in the short intake form: allergies, food limits, injuries and anything you want us to plan around. You choose what to share. We never ask for weight or body-measurement targets.","u":"2026-11-20T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Health","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Nov 20, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Nov 20 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Tosin)","d":"Shoot is Fri Dec 4, 2026, 9:00 AM Lagos at Lagos studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Tosin and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-20T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 20, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:PO1","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Pose sheet #1: send your 10 poses","d":"Editorial practice (no runway push): 10 poses in 3 looks in front of a mirror, plus 5 expressions for close-ups. Send a 10-pose contact sheet each check date. Due Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:SKP","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Start your skin plan: read and confirm","d":"Every day: AM gentle cleanser, moisturizer, broad-spectrum SPF 30+. PM: remove sunscreen and makeup fully (double cleanse on shoot days), then moisturizer. Once a week: one gentle exfoliation and one hydrating mask. Patch-test anything new on the jaw for 3 days. Never sleep in makeup. If you shave, use a clean blade, shave with the grain and finish with an alcohol-free soother. Climate: heat and humidity. Use a gel or light lotion moisturizer. For breakouts or dark marks after breakouts, ask the reviewer about niacinamide in the morning and azelaic acid at night. Reapply SPF every 2 to 3 hours outdoors and rinse sweat off before it dries. Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history.","u":"2026-11-23T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Nov 23, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Nov 23 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:FUEL","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Your fueling plan: read it and send allergies or food limits","d":"This is healthy fueling, not dieting. Three meals and two snacks a day, protein at every meal, a vegetable or fruit at most meals, whole grains or starch for energy on training and walk-practice days, and 2 to 3 liters of water. No crash dieting, cleanses, diet pills or skipped meals. MDV does not set weight or measurement targets for any model. If a doctor or dietitian gives you a plan, that plan wins. Tell us any allergies or food limits in your health intake so this plan fits you. Easy local picks: grilled or steamed fish or chicken, beans or moi moi, efo riro or ugu with less oil, boiled or grilled plantain, ofada or brown rice, and fruit like pawpaw, oranges and watermelon. Jollof and fried snacks are fine in smaller portions with a protein beside them.","u":"2026-11-25T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Diet","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Wed Nov 25, 5:00 PM Lagos (Wed Nov 25 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:PA3","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Sign off the gameplan and test shoot plan (Tosin Florence)","d":"Review the gameplan, test shoot dates and image rules, then approve or comment.","u":"2026-11-25T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"agent","h":false,"ar":"Gameplan","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Nov 25, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 concept (Tosin Florence)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Fri Dec 4, 2026.","u":"2026-11-27T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Nov 27, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS2-team","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: lock photographer, MUA, stylist and studio (Tosin)","d":"Shoot is Mon Dec 14, 2026, 9:00 AM Lagos at Lagos studio. Book photographer, makeup, hair, stylist and studio, send the mood board to Tosin and the mother agency, and confirm wardrobe. HARD STOP: shoot cannot slip after this time.","u":"2026-11-30T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Nov 30, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send call sheet (Tosin)","d":"Call sheet to Tosin and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lagos, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-01T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 1, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-confirm","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Confirm your test shoot 1 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Fri Dec 4, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-02T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Wed Dec 2, 5:00 PM Lagos (Wed Dec 2 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Test shoot 1: Tosin","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lagos studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-04T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 4, 9:00 AM Lagos (Fri Dec 4 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-04T16:00:00Z","loc":"Lagos studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS2-concept","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 2 concept (Tosin Florence)","d":"Please approve or comment on the concept and looks for the test shoot on Mon Dec 14, 2026.","u":"2026-12-07T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Mon Dec 7, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: send selects (Tosin)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-08T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 8, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-approve","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Approve your test shoot 1 selects","d":"Pick your favorites and tell your agent what you do not want used. Tap Complete when done.","u":"2026-12-10T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Thu Dec 10, 5:00 PM Lagos (Thu Dec 10 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-papprove","a":"partner","o":"Mother agency","t":"Approve test shoot 1 selects (Tosin Florence)","d":"Approve the selects or send notes so the retouch can start.","u":"2026-12-10T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 10, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS2-confirm","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Confirm your test shoot 2 call sheet","d":"Tap Complete when you have read the call sheet and confirm you can be there at 9:00 AM on Mon Dec 14, 2026. Skin prep: no new products, no waxing, sleep 8 hours.","u":"2026-12-11T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Fri Dec 11, 5:00 PM Lagos (Fri Dec 11 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS2-callsheet","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send call sheet (Tosin)","d":"Call sheet to Tosin and mother agency: address, call time 9:00 AM Lagos, wardrobe, skin prep and what to eat.","u":"2026-12-11T17:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Fri Dec 11, 12:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS2","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Test shoot 2: Tosin","d":"Call time 9:00 AM, wrap about 5:00 PM. Lagos studio. Bring a clean face, hair as discussed, and snacks.","u":"2026-12-14T08:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"test","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 9:00 AM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 3:00 AM ET)","en":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","loc":"Lagos studio","ek":""},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:PO2","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Pose sheet #2: send your 10 poses","d":"Editorial practice (no runway push): 10 poses in 3 looks in front of a mirror, plus 5 expressions for close-ups. Send a 10-pose contact sheet each check date. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"training","h":false,"ar":"Walk","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:SK2","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Skin submission #2 (progress): photos due","d":"Skin submission = 4 photos in daylight by a window, no makeup, no filter, no retouching: front, left, right, and a close-up of any area you want help with. Add three lines: skin type as you see it, any concerns, and any product reaction. A licensed skin professional reviews it. You can choose to share only the photos and not any medical history. Due Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET).","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"progress_submission","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:SK2e","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Skin submission #2 due","d":"Upload your skin photos in the portal today.","u":"2026-12-14T16:00:00Z","k":"e","ty":"deadline","h":false,"ar":"Skin","z":"Africa/Lagos","w":"Mon Dec 14, 5:00 PM Lagos (Mon Dec 14 11:00 AM ET)","en":null,"loc":null,"ek":"model meeting"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-retouch","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: retouched finals delivered (Tosin)","d":"Retouched finals saved to the model's media in the portal.","u":"2026-12-15T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Tue Dec 15, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS2-selects","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 2: send selects (Tosin)","d":"Send the first selects to the model and mother agency for approval.","u":"2026-12-16T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":false,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Wed Dec 16, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:TS1-package","a":"staff","o":"Erica","t":"Test shoot 1: add to book and push the package (Tosin)","d":"Add the images to the book and website, then send the package to clients and mother agencies.","u":"2026-12-17T22:00:00Z","k":"t","ty":"testing","h":true,"ar":"Test shoot","z":"America/New_York","w":"Thu Dec 17, 5:00 PM ET"},{"i":"g90:tosin-florence:H2","a":"model","o":"Tosin Florence","t":"Physical exam and bloodwork: done and cleared","d":"Physical exam and bloodwork as your